  <text>4008</text><!-- 2026-10-04: refresh gift-machine copy and general claim warning from migration 585. Prior 2658. --><!-- bumped 2026-10-04 - migrations 580/582/584 seed game_display_names for 990212/990213/990211 (the invite pane and 1v1 menu read names from listGames_<locale>.action). Prior 2657 --><!-- bumped 2026-09-12 — development environment recovery invalidated the shared list*.action cache after restoring migration and i18n availability. Prior 2333. --><!-- bumped 2026-09-07 - migration 513 seeds game_display_names (990215,iw) and retires game 202. The invite pane and the 1v1 menu read a game name from listGames_<locale>.action (TextResourceManager.getGameData), not from games.name; without the bump clients keep the cached catalog and show the dash-stub fallback. Prior 2179 --><!-- bumped 2026-08-29 — migration 503 corrects game 202's Hebrew title to "אבן נייר ומספריים" and supplies its live 1v1 description. The invite pane reads listGames_<locale>.action, so returning clients must refetch text. Prior 2177. --><!-- bumped 2026-08-25 — migration 496 seeds game_display_names (990214,'iw')='דמקה'. The invite pane and the 1v1 menu read a game's name from listGames_<locale>.action (TextResourceManager.getGameData), not from games.name, and every list*.action shares this one ?version — without the bump clients keep the cached catalog and render the new game with the dash-stub fallback instead of its Hebrew name. Prior 2176 --><!-- bumped 2026-08-15 — mig 482 renames game 33 to "משיכת הזבל" and gives it the land subtitle. The client reads a game's name AND description from listGames_<locale>.action (TextResourceManager.getGameData), not from games.name, and every list*.action shares this one ?version — without the bump clients keep the cached catalog and still show "מנקים במעמקים" with the sea description. Prior 2175 --><!-- bumped 2026-08-13 §i18n (second) — mig 411 renames game 34 to "זוחלים אל החופש" in game_display_names; the client reads the slot title 